Z||000001||DrRodey||02-17-2001||08:16 AM||||Nein, Nein mein Freunde.  "Achtung" sind nicht Hello, es ist attention so wie "watch out".  Fur Hello du must, Gutten Tag oder Gruss Dich sagen.  <P>if you want it translated just ask.<P>------------------<BR>Hi... My names Dan, and i'm addicted to Fieros.<BR>'88 Formula CONVERTIBLE<BR>'85 Coupe<BR>AOL IM = drrodey<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/files/fieroPage.JPG">          <BR> <A HREF="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html" TARGET=_blank>freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html</A>||||reg||1
